    avg_visit_minutes 60
    price_level 1
    popularity_score 4.74
    description "Taksim Square, situated in Beyo&#287;lu in the European part of Istanbul, Turkey, is a major tourist and leisure district famed for its restaurants, shops, and hotels. It is considered the heart of modern Istanbul, with the central station of the Istanbul Metro network. Taksim Square is also the location of the Republic Monument which was crafted by Pietro Canonica and inaugurated in 1928."
    destination_id "IST"
    open_hour 8
    close_hour 20
  ]
