    description "The MuseumsQuartier Wien (MQ) is an arts and culture complex in the 7th district of Vienna, Austria. Opened in 2001 on the site of the former imperial court stables, it combines historic Baroque buildings with contemporary museum architecture. With 114,310 square metres of space, 61 cultural institutions and around five million visitors annually, it is one of the largest arts and culture complexes in Europe."
